sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Profile A (already connected)
    participant S as Server (match mailbox)
    participant B as Profile B (late joiner)

    A->>S: STRING_BROADCAST (lifecycle = MATCH)
    Note over S: buffered in A's match outbox

    B->>S: connect() after SIGNALING handshake
    S->>S: synthesize SIGNAL_JOIN, CONNECT
    alt no host currently assigned
        S->>S: assign B as host
        S-->>A: HOST broadcast
        S-->>B: HOST broadcast
    end
    S-->>B: replay backlog: SIGNAL_JOIN, SIGNAL_LEAVE,<br/>CONNECT, HOST, and any MATCH-lifecycle signals
    Note over B: B is now caught up on roster<br/>and any late-joiner game state
